{"vid":"AKUxbgjR9sg","source":"AKUxbgjR9sg.en.json3","lang":"en","cues":[{"t":0.9,"txt":"business skills 360 the podcast that looks at the other side of business English"},{"t":10.8,"txt":"hello and welcome back to the skills 360 podcast I'm your host Tim"},{"t":18.2,"txt":"Simmons and today I want to look at how to prepare for an interview in English"},{"t":26.7,"txt":"when I say prepare I'm not talking about making an appointment at the hair salon"},{"t":33.2,"txt":"or picking out a clean shirt I'm talking about doing some research anticipating"},{"t":42.5,"txt":"what you'll be asked and practicing how to respond yeah I know I'm always going"},{"t":51.7,"txt":"on about preparation but this time it's not just a suggestion it's essential if"},{"t":60.3,"txt":"you do it right you'll be able to head into the interview feeling relaxed and"},{"t":66.7,"txt":"confident and that will increase your chances of landing the job now here's"},{"t":75.3,"txt":"the thing most interviews cover the same basic territory sure you might get a"},{"t":83.3,"txt":"couple of curveballs but for the most part you can predict what questions"},{"t":89,"txt":"you'll be asked and that means you can plan your answers I don't mean script"},{"t":97,"txt":"your answers it's pretty tough to appear authentic and natural while delivering a"},{"t":105,"txt":"memorized response but you can outline your answers and practice your delivery"},{"t":113.5,"txt":"so how do we go about doing that well let's start by talking about how to"},{"t":121.2,"txt":"introduce yourself in an interview in English the old tell me about yourself"},{"t":129.2,"txt":"question it's a amazing how many people are thrown by"},{"t":134,"txt":"this question or fumble through an awkward response as they wait for the"},{"t":139.9,"txt":"real interview questions but first impressions are important and you need a"},{"t":147,"txt":"good answer for tell me about yourself my advice is to keep it succinct instead"},{"t":156.4,"txt":"of rambling on keep it professional but show passion and keep it positive and if"},{"t":166,"txt":"you need a formula try present past future how does that work check out this"},{"t":175,"txt":"example I'm currently a marketing manager with a medium-sized software"},{"t":181.1,"txt":"firm since I was young I've loved writing and design and all things tech"},{"t":187.9,"txt":"so in university marketing felt like the perfect fit and I went straight from"},{"t":194.4,"txt":"college to IBM where I worked for five years I'm happy with what I've"},{"t":200.2,"txt":"accomplished but I'm really looking for a new challenge now and I love what you"},{"t":205.7,"txt":"guys are doing in that example you heard me mention my current position my"},{"t":212.7,"txt":"educational and work background and the change I want in the future if you"},{"t":220.6,"txt":"master your tell me about yourself pitch you can practice responding to the"},{"t":226.9,"txt":"next most common English interview question what are your strengths first a"},{"t":233.7,"txt":"don't don't give them a laundry list of random skills like well I'm good at"},{"t":243.3,"txt":"communication organizing teamwork and I take the initiative all the time"},{"t":250.1,"txt":"that's totally forgettable instead choose two or three important strengths"},{"t":260,"txt":"that relate directly to the position you're applying for"},{"t":264.9,"txt":"choose ones that will set you apart from others and give some evidence so if"},{"t":272.4,"txt":"you're applying for a marketing manager position you might say people tell me"},{"t":278.3,"txt":"that I'm a creative manager I can motivate a team and make people feel"},{"t":284.1,"txt":"appreciated for example our team recently tackled a tough project for a"},{"t":289.7,"txt":"really demanding client and did you notice that I said people tell me that"},{"t":296.8,"txt":"I'm a creative manager it's not just your opinion you're telling them that"},{"t":303.6,"txt":"other people think so too now I wouldn't necessarily take the same"},{"t":309.9,"txt":"approach to the next type of question you're bound to face and which you"},{"t":315.6,"txt":"probably dread answering the what are your weaknesses question yes you're sure"},{"t":324.6,"txt":"to get this question in a job interview so you'd better be ready for it three"},{"t":331.5,"txt":"bits of advice first don't choose something that's actually a strength I'm"},{"t":338.4,"txt":"talking about the old well sometimes I'm too much of a perfectionist they've"},{"t":345.6,"txt":"heard that before it doesn't fly anymore secondly choose something that isn't"},{"t":352.4,"txt":"central to the position you're applying for thirdly talk about how you've worked"},{"t":359.2,"txt":"to improve this weakness let's say you're applying for a marketing manager"},{"t":366,"txt":"position and you're asked about a weakness you might try something like"},{"t":371.8,"txt":"this in the past I've struggled with public speaking giving presentations to"},{"t":378.5,"txt":"large groups of people at a conference for example is a real challenge"},{"t":383.7,"txt":"that said I've joined Toastmasters and I've been working hard to develop more"},{"t":389.7,"txt":"confidence with this other good weaknesses to talk about being patient"},{"t":396.2,"txt":"when working on a team delegating responsibilities giving"},{"t":402,"txt":"feedback or analyzing data if one of those isn't central to the role it could"},{"t":410,"txt":"be a good one to mention all right how about a quick recap of these tips first"},{"t":418.4,"txt":"practice a good response - tell me about yourself that's professional passionate"},{"t":426.8,"txt":"positive and succinct second talk about strengths that are related to the job"},{"t":434.5,"txt":"and set you apart from others and third talk about a weakness that doesn't blow"},{"t":442.3,"txt":"up your chances of getting the position and that you've worked to improve that's"},{"t":449.2,"txt":"all for today if you'd like to test yourself on what we've just covered have"},{"t":455.2,"txt":"a look at the business English pod dot-com website"},{"t":459.7,"txt":"there you'll find a quiz about today's show as well as a PDF transcript so long"},{"t":467.6,"txt":"and see you again soon"}],"words":[{"t":0.94,"w":"business"},{"t":0.94,"w":"skills"},{"t":0.94,"w":"360"},{"t":0.94,"w":"the"},{"t":0.94,"w":"podcast"},{"t":0.94,"w":"that"},{"t":0.94,"w":"looks"},{"t":0.94,"w":"at"},{"t":0.94,"w":"the"},{"t":0.94,"w":"other"},{"t":0.94,"w":"side"},{"t":0.94,"w":"of"},{"t":0.94,"w":"business"},{"t":0.94,"w":"English"},{"t":10.78,"w":"hello"},{"t":10.78,"w":"and"},{"t":10.78,"w":"welcome"},{"t":10.78,"w":"back"},{"t":10.78,"w":"to"},{"t":10.78,"w":"the"},{"t":10.78,"w":"skills"},{"t":10.78,"w":"360"},{"t":10.78,"w":"podcast"},{"t":10.78,"w":"I'm"},{"t":10.78,"w":"your"},{"t":10.78,"w":"host"},{"t":10.78,"w":"Tim"},{"t":18.18,"w":"Simmons"},{"t":18.18,"w":"and"},{"t":18.18,"w":"today"},{"t":18.18,"w":"I"},{"t":18.18,"w":"want"},{"t":18.18,"w":"to"},{"t":18.18,"w":"look"},{"t":18.18,"w":"at"},{"t":18.18,"w":"how"},{"t":18.18,"w":"to"},{"t":18.18,"w":"prepare"},{"t":18.18,"w":"for"},{"t":18.18,"w":"an"},{"t":18.18,"w":"interview"},{"t":18.18,"w":"in"},{"t":18.18,"w":"English"},{"t":26.72,"w":"when"},{"t":26.72,"w":"I"},{"t":26.72,"w":"say"},{"t":26.72,"w":"prepare"},{"t":26.72,"w":"I'm"},{"t":26.72,"w":"not"},{"t":26.72,"w":"talking"},{"t":26.72,"w":"about"},{"t":26.72,"w":"making"},{"t":26.72,"w":"an"},{"t":26.72,"w":"appointment"},{"t":26.72,"w":"at"},{"t":26.72,"w":"the"},{"t":26.72,"w":"hair"},{"t":26.72,"w":"salon"},{"t":33.18,"w":"or"},{"t":33.18,"w":"picking"},{"t":33.18,"w":"out"},{"t":33.18,"w":"a"},{"t":33.18,"w":"clean"},{"t":33.18,"w":"shirt"},{"t":33.18,"w":"I'm"},{"t":33.18,"w":"talking"},{"t":33.18,"w":"about"},{"t":33.18,"w":"doing"},{"t":33.18,"w":"some"},{"t":33.18,"w":"research"},{"t":33.18,"w":"anticipating"},{"t":42.45,"w":"what"},{"t":42.45,"w":"you'll"},{"t":42.45,"w":"be"},{"t":42